2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T16:12:05-07:00","id":866556,"title":"","content":"Oh I'd definitely be up for contributing to the Neolithic setting too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T17:22:49-07:00","id":866580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar?p=866480#post866480\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Quick note on the Awakened file: Imhotep wasn't a pharaoh, he was High Priest of Re, and polymath architect. I'd actually leave the possibility open that he could be Awakened, but have it disputed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Woops. Thanks for pointing that out. I'll correct it when I got time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T17:25:40-07:00","id":866581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar?p=866542#post866542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Excellent- I'll have a thread up just as soon as I have material for it. So probably Tuesday.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sweet <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm looking forward to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T03:00:50-07:00","id":866739,"title":"","content":"Thought up the Gift for a possible Mekhet Bloodline that could be tied to the Cult of Shezmu. Any ideas for the rest of the write-up are welcome.<br /> <br /> -+-<br /> <br /> <b><u>Bloodline Gift: Lords of Wine</u></b><br /> As they were chosen by Shezmu himself, the Slaughterers partook of some of his greater blessings, and could siphon facets of the Fivefold Soul through the blood drained from the Remet.<br /> <br /> The vampire is considered to have a number of Pillar dots equal to half his Blood Potency (rounded up), which he may allocate to any Pillar except Ka. He can also spend Willpower to convert Vitae into Pillar points on a one-to-one basis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T11:38:23-07:00","id":866953,"title":"","content":"I'm assuming you're calling the Bloodline &quot;Slaughterers&quot;? I don't think they'd be a Mekhet Bloodline, as much as it would make sense given the setting fluff- these 'Slaughterers' are servants of the Cult, and just the idea of them makes me think Ushabti (IE. Nosferatu)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1098_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1098\" data-vbnamecard=\"1098\">glamourweaver</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar281_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"281\" data-vbnamecard=\"281\">atamajakki</a> I'll give you guys a head's up when the thread goes up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T14:45:33-07:00","id":867068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar?p=866953#post866953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm assuming you're calling the Bloodline &amp;quot;Slaughterers&amp;quot;? I don't think they'd be a Mekhet Bloodline, as much as it would make sense given the setting fluff- these 'Slaughterers' are servants of the Cult, and just the idea of them makes me think Ushabti.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually thinking of making them Ushabti instead. Anyways, trying to see if I can find another name for them so that Slaughterers can be a nickname for them.<br /> <br /> And what do you think of their Bloodline Gift? I was initially going for something related to Acherusian Wine, and I <i>might</i> work out Merits which allow them to more effectively use that Relic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T23:20:35-07:00","id":867388,"title":"","content":"Are the Nepri born in this era in failed immitation of the Rite of Return?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T00:30:41-07:00","id":867409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar?p=867388#post867388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the Nepri born in this era in failed immitation of the Rite of Return?</div> </div> </div> </div>Haven't they always been?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T00:39:41-07:00","id":867415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar?p=867409#post867409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Haven't they always been?</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean, haven't they always existed? No indication of that I'm aware of. At least in First Edition all the Lineages dated back to demiurges creating the first of their kind (or the first of their kind being creaed Extemporae).<br /> <br /> Also wouldn't make much sense <i><b>in a crossover game</b></i>, if a Lineage based on the Osiris myth predated the events that inspired said myth according to MtC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T04:54:13-07:00","id":868321,"title":"","content":"Here's what I worked out as flavor text for Acanthus Mages in Age of Azar.<br /> <br /> -+-<br /> <br /> <b>Ren (The Path of Names)</b><br /> The Name is the anchor to which everything else is affixed. It shapes and guides a person's identity, and governs all aspects of his life. To lose it would leave one forgotten, erased from the Scroll of Ages and destined to fade into nothing.<br /> <br /> Hemka who Awaken to the Path strongly tied to their Ren have an intimate knowledge in the power of Names. Learning an individual's name grants them power over his place in the Scroll. And by rewriting that tale through the power of their will, they can change his very Fate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":8180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","user":"Deionscribe","date":". 04-19-2016, 07:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T05:32:58-07:00","id":868336,"title":"","content":"And another for the Mastigos. <br /> <br /> -+- <br /> <br /> <b>Ba (The Path of Passions)</b> <br /> The Ba is driven and impulsive. It is the embodiment of one's thoughts, and all that lingers should he fail to pass on to Starry A'aru. When merged with the energies of heka, this Pillar of the soul becomes the source of Awakening. <br /> <br /> The Hemka whose souls resonate the strongest with the Ba are those best equipped to delve into the Mysteries found in A'aru. Such an instinctive understanding of the ways used to enter that paradise also allow them to exert their will on its guardians. These sorcerer-priests can just as easily command mortal minds, and can even do so at a distance by directing their spells through the proper currents of heka.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":8180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","user":"Deionscribe","date":". 04-19-2016, 08:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T06:41:36-07:00","id":868380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar?p=867388#post867388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the Nepri born in this era in failed immitation of the Rite of Return?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Probably a little bit later, after the Cult of Azar has been firmly established, but yes, the Nepri are almost certainly born into this era.<br /> <br /> EDIT: As a side note, we just passed 2000 views. Hurrah!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T15:36:29-07:00","id":868830,"title":"","content":"So I'm working on a writeup of the Purified in the Sundered World, but that makes me ask how the lesser templates fit into the Age of Azar?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T19:18:40-07:00","id":869000,"title":"","content":"Lesser Templates as in the Bluebook templates, or things like Ghouls, Wolf-Blooded, etc? The Purified themselves are almost certainly created in an attempt to replicate the Rite of Return.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 20